{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新疆阿勒泰地區的喀納斯景區經歷雨雪過後出現秋冬交融的獨特景觀。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503085_新疆喀納斯 秋雪同框奇景 done.mp4 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/0f74ee9cfe9c4b3f951173781ea06a16/snapshots/2bda8668eaff4c82baa4a70529cb33bf-00005.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>降水過後，阿爾泰山中段因垂直海拔造成的溫差，將這片景致分割成金色與銀色相間的條紋。在海拔較低的河谷，氣溫較高、降水多以雨夾雪形式落下，森林仍保留斑斕秋色。相反，在海拔較高的山脊及山地森林，氣溫跌至零度以下，呈現一派廣闊的冬日景象。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503085_新疆喀納斯 秋雪同框奇景 done.mp4 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/0f74ee9cfe9c4b3f951173781ea06a16/snapshots/2bda8668eaff4c82baa4a70529cb33bf-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T00:39:37.693697+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:38:05.743356+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:38.195406+00:00","content_hash":"329f844b630ac3301b4b93c4ed3ba9a12d9be5849247fcc50a8399111bb62d0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}